      <p class="prerequisite-lead">Installing BrowserGym alone does not provide the original WebArena or VisualWebArena sites. Their integrations need several configured domains; those full suites have no result here. The upstream combined VisualWebArena/WebArena Docker example recommends an EC2 host with a 1,000 GB EBS root volume, so check storage and prepare every service before a full run. The separate WebArena Verified run below covers {verifiedNavigationCount} read-only navigation tasks in one synthetic shopping_admin site.</p>
